.TH HYPERWHISPER 1 "August 2026" "HyperWhisper 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hyperwhisper \- private, fast speech-to-text desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hyperwhisper
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B HyperWhisper
records speech and turns it into text using local or cloud transcription
engines. Configuration and recording controls are available through the
desktop application.
.SH INPUT ACCESS
Global hotkeys and transcript injection require membership in the
.B hyperwhisper-input
system group. An administrator can add a user with
.B usermod -aG hyperwhisper-input USER
and the user must then re-login.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /etc/udev/rules.d/70-hyperwhisper-input.rules
Device permissions installed by the package maintainer script.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tesseract (1)
